      "detail": "Alice’s phone, an app on her laptop, registers with her provider’s SIP server: alice@example.net can be reached here. The server answers 401 with a challenge, so the phone asks again with a hash made from the challenge and its password. 200 OK: registered for an hour.",
      "facts": [
        [
          "Port",
          "UDP 5060"
        ],
        [
          "Login",
          "A hash, not the password"
        ],
        [
          "Good for",
          "3600 s, then again"
        ]
      ],
